{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux主机发起疑似网段扫描。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：Potential Network Scan Executed From Host。","from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","endgame-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux主机发起疑似网段扫描","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux主机发起疑似网段扫描\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清主机、网络或权限\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":47,"rule_id":"03c23d45-d3cb-4ad4-ab5d-b361ffe8724a","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"threshold","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:linux and event.type:start and\nevent.action:(exec or exec_event or executed or process_started or start or ProcessRollup2) and\nprocess.name:(ping or nping or hping or hping2 or hping3 or nc or ncat or netcat or socat)\n","threshold":{"field":["host.id","process.parent.entity_id","process.executable"],"value":1,"cardinality":[{"field":"process.args","value":100}]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1018","name":"Remote System Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1018/"},{"id":"T1046","name":"Network Service Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1046/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":9,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
